WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.102
This is the Skills Workbench,

2
00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:05.183
where you teach Claude your way of doing something,

3
00:00:05.183 --> 00:00:05.485
once.

4
00:00:05.485 --> 00:00:07.781
A skill is a saved set of instructions

5
00:00:07.781 --> 00:00:10.258
that Claude picks up when a task matches,

6
00:00:10.258 --> 00:00:12.131
or when you ask for it by name.

7
00:00:12.131 --> 00:00:13.642
Here's the rule of thumb:

8
00:00:13.642 --> 00:00:16.421
if you've explained something to Claude twice,

9
00:00:16.421 --> 00:00:17.690
it should be a skill.

10
00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:18.777
The easiest start?

11
00:00:18.777 --> 00:00:21.436
Just tell Claude you'd like to make a skill,

12
00:00:21.436 --> 00:00:23.369
and describe how you do the job.

13
00:00:23.369 --> 00:00:25.182
Then test it on a tricky case.

14
00:00:25.182 --> 00:00:26.390
Did it get it right?
